'''Mana Disintegrator''' is a {{Rare}} upgrade item from [[Blaze Slayer]]. It reduces mana cost of deployables and wands.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
'''Mana Disintegrator''' is a {{Odds|rare}} drops from {{MobSprite|Inferno Demonlord}} {{SlayerTier|2}}+ upon reaching {{Coll|Blaze Slayer 2}}.

== Usage ==
It can be used in an [[Anvil]] with any deployable or wand. This reduces their {{Stat|Mana}} cost by {{aqua|1%}}. After combining, it is consumed.

Up to {{Green|10}} '''Mana Disintegrators''' can be applied to an item, reducing its mana cost up to {{aqua|10%}}.

In the case of [[Power Orbs]], the mana cost is reduced by {{Aqua|2%}} per level up to {{Aqua|20%}}. (This appears as a decrease from 50% to 40% of the user's maximum mana.)

