== Notes ==
*The effect stacks multiplicatively with the {{Attr|Breeze}} attribute, for a total reduction of {{aqua|19%}}.
*It also stacks multiplicatively with {{Item|Wise Dragon Armor}}'s set bonus, for a total reduction of {{aqua|40%}}.
*While working properly on {{Item|Totem of Corruption}}, the reduced mana cost won't be shown on the tooltip, as it is with other items.

== Trivia ==
*'''Mana Disintegrators''' can be applied to the {{Item|Small Pocket Black Hole|text=Small}} and {{Item|Medium Pocket Black Hole}}, but have no effect as they have no mana cost.
*The above also applies to the {{Item|Hollow Wand}}, which consumes {{Gold|Spirit ⚶}} stacks instead of mana. (verify)

